    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36732b01574e1796",
      "translationZh": "HuatuoGPT-3-27B 是一个基于 Qwen3.8-27B 并采用单阶段策略优化（One-stage Policy Optimization, OnePO）构建的医学大语言模型。OnePO 通过单个强化学习阶段将语言模型适配到医学领域，而无需预先进行特定领域的监督微调。教师响应提供临时指导，并随着模型的改进而逐渐退出。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5e5da244ffd8aba",
      "translationZh": "我们发布了训练代码、医学强化学习（RL）数据集以及 8B 评分标准评估器（rubric grader）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23f2bf87ab139ea7",
      "translationZh": "（上周他们发布了 https://huggingface.co/FreedomIntelligence/HuatuoGPT-3-9B ）",
